Are you planning to drop out of school?

278
00:23:57.250 --> 00:23:59.880
You know you have to get your diploma before you can retake the exam, right?

279
00:24:00.360 --> 00:24:01.450
Teacher Jin

280
00:24:01.450 --> 00:24:02.840
why are you still here

281
00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:03.760
Come to the classroom quickly

282
00:24:03.760 --> 00:24:04.560
Good

283
00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:09.150
We'll talk about this later

284
00:24:23.390 --> 00:24:24.340
Liu Jieyi

285
00:24:32.150 --> 00:24:33.400
congratulations

286
00:24:36.000 --> 00:24:37.470
Congratulations on getting perfect scores

287
00:24:37.470 --> 00:24:39.250
Which department do you plan to apply for?

288
00:24:39.250 --> 00:24:41.870
I heard that the difficulty of this year’s exam is at a record high
You are the only candidate with perfect scores in the country

289
00:24:41.870 --> 00:24:43.160
What is your secret to reading?

290
00:24:43.160 --> 00:24:45.110
Especially in mathematics, everyone says the questions are difficult

291
00:24:45.110 --> 00:24:47.000
Did you ever think you would do so well in the exam?

292
00:25:05.300 --> 00:25:07.500
In fact, I already knew
As long as you fill in the answer card correctly

293
00:25:07.500 --> 00:25:09.990
I will definitely get full marks

294
00:25:09.990 --> 00:25:12.160
I plan to apply for the Department of Medicine at a Korean University

295
00:25:12.160 --> 00:25:13.280
Following in my father's footsteps

296
00:25:13.280 --> 00:25:14.810
become a doctor

297
00:25:18.840 --> 00:25:21.530
This is the power of genes, right?

298
00:25:21.530 --> 00:25:24.270
Congratulations to Dr. Liu Taijun of J Medical Center

299
00:25:24.270 --> 00:25:25.370
thank you

300
00:25:26.330 --> 00:25:29.010
Your daughter is the only one in the country who got a perfect score in the college entrance examination

301
00:25:29.010 --> 00:25:30.540
how are you feeling now

302
00:25:30.540 --> 00:25:32.810
There is something about the efforts of the past nineteen years

303
00:25:32.810 --> 00:25:35.070
The feeling of finally being rewarded

304
00:25:35.820 --> 00:25:37.020
Yes

305
00:25:37.020 --> 00:25:41.530
After all, there is such a thing as entering a higher school
Parents and children need to work together

306
00:25:41.530 --> 00:25:46.580
What's your secret?
Do you want your daughter to be number one in the country?

307
00:25:46.580 --> 00:25:50.160
If I say I didn't do anything in particular
People may be angry

308
00:25:50.160 --> 00:25:51.960
-But I'm actually just like any other parent...
- so funny

309
00:25:51.960 --> 00:25:54.640
Try to let her eat a nutritionally balanced diet
Give her lots of love and support

310
00:25:52.340 --> 00:25:54.500
[The exclusive secret to getting perfect scores in college exams]

311
00:25:55.700 --> 00:25:56.940
But I guess the most important thing is...

312
00:25:56.940 --> 00:26:01.350
I believe my daughter will do well in the exam

313
00:25:59.500 --> 00:26:03.820
[The unknown secret behind the perfect score in the college entrance examination]

314
00:26:35.640 --> 00:26:38.840
Sister, let’s get ready to go to kindergarten.

315
00:27:13.960 --> 00:27:15.960
The weather is a bit cold today

316
00:27:18.720 --> 00:27:20.380
Can you bear it?

317
00:27:37.280 --> 00:27:41.700
Jay, how were you feeling at that time?

318
00:27:43.610 --> 00:27:45.170
It's fear...

319
00:27:47.020 --> 00:27:48.460
It’s fear…

320
00:27:52.050 --> 00:27:53.020
Or...

321
00:27:55.480 --> 00:27:58.200
You are actually very happy

322
00:28:17.440 --> 00:28:18.690
What's wrong

323
00:28:18.690 --> 00:28:19.730
what happened

324
00:28:20.390 --> 00:28:21.350
The dean’s daughter committed suicide by jumping into the river

325
00:28:21.350 --> 00:28:22.320
How could it be

326
00:28:22.320 --> 00:28:22.980
Liu Jieyi?

327
00:28:22.980 --> 00:28:23.760
What's going on

328
00:28:23.760 --> 00:28:24.610
Is she still on live broadcast?

329
00:28:24.610 --> 00:28:26.570
What are you doing? Please put subtitles.

330
00:28:28.570 --> 00:28:30.100
Just received the latest news

331
00:28:30.100 --> 00:28:32.900
Get full marks on the university entrance exam
Liu, a classmate from "A Girls' High School in Jiangnan"

332
00:28:32.900 --> 00:28:36.050
I just committed suicide by drowning myself in the river.

333
00:28:36.280 --> 00:28:37.610
I repeat it again

334
00:28:37.610 --> 00:28:39.320
Student Liu got perfect scores in the university entrance exam

335
00:28:37.660 --> 00:28:39.700
[Flash report: A girl from a certain girls’ high school in Jiangnan got perfect marks in the college entrance examination
Student Liu just committed suicide by throwing himself into the river]

336
00:28:39.320 --> 00:28:42.200
I just committed suicide by drowning myself in the river.

337
00:28:44.730 --> 00:28:46.640
Borrow it

338
00:28:46.920 --> 00:28:48.650
Officer, how is the search progress now?

339
00:28:48.650 --> 00:28:49.700
Let’s talk about it later

340
00:28:53.240 --> 00:28:56.040
-Borrowed it
-Have you found anyone yet?

341
00:29:06.460 --> 00:29:07.720
Found it

342
00:29:08.600 --> 00:29:09.800
here

343
00:29:13.530 --> 00:29:15.560
Snap shot…

344
00:29:38.630 --> 00:29:39.960
Sister Jina

345
00:29:40.490 --> 00:29:41.960
She…

346
00:29:41.960 --> 00:29:43.520
really alive

347
00:29:47.580 --> 00:29:49.740
Where is Jay? Where is Jay?

348
00:29:49.740 --> 00:29:50.970
We will continue to search

349
00:29:55.590 --> 00:29:57.930
Miss, what's your name?

350
00:29:58.620 --> 00:30:00.490
please tell me your name

351
00:30:02.250 --> 00:30:04.690
Please help me find Jay

352
00:30:06.300 --> 00:30:08.180
Hurry up

353
00:30:12.100 --> 00:30:15.770
Please help me find Jay

354
00:30:18.650 --> 00:30:20.790
Please...

355
00:30:22.760 --> 00:30:24.620
I should have noticed it then

356
00:30:24.620 --> 00:30:25.690
Jay

357
00:30:31.770 --> 00:30:35.950
Which season is your heart going through?

358
00:30:42.340 --> 00:30:45.430
Liu, the director of a well-known medical center in Jiangnan

359
00:30:45.430 --> 00:30:51.170
Suspected of illegally stealing college entrance exams for his children
Difficult questions in mathematics

360
00:30:51.960 --> 00:30:54.800
Not only did he steal the 2025 exam questions

361
00:30:54.800 --> 00:30:58.720
Also stole the 2024 exam questions

362
00:30:58.720 --> 00:31:02.210
Even killing one in the process
Question committee member named Yu

363
00:31:02.210 --> 00:31:03.220
he came out

364
00:31:04.460 --> 00:31:06.200
Mr. Liu Taijun…

365
00:31:06.200 --> 00:31:08.550
Your eldest daughter is obviously still alive
Why do you say she is dead?

366
00:31:08.550 --> 00:31:11.480
The victim's family thinks you're trying to cover it up
The facts of the murder. What's your version?

367
00:31:11.480 --> 00:31:15.340
For the second daughter who jumped off the building after revealing everything
do you have anything to say

368
00:31:18.090 --> 00:31:21.080
As long as you don't see the body
I will keep looking

369
00:31:22.300 --> 00:31:23.740
Do you understand what dad means?

370
00:31:24.740 --> 00:31:26.050
Okay, let's go

371
00:31:27.180 --> 00:31:31.860
Mr. Liu Taijun...please say a few words...

372
00:31:31.860 --> 00:31:34.300
[Six months later]

373
00:31:33.490 --> 00:31:38.880
-Please thoroughly investigate the truth about the entrance examination case
-The weather is so hot, let’s have some ice...

374
00:31:38.880 --> 00:31:41.280
My daughter doesn't want to be interviewed

375
00:31:41.540 --> 00:31:43.570
The weather is so hot. You should go back.

376
00:31:44.760 --> 00:31:47.060
It was revealed that she was captured in the video

377
00:31:47.060 --> 00:31:48.490
She went to see Park Minghao

378
00:31:48.490 --> 00:31:50.180
He was even sent to the operating room

379
00:31:50.180 --> 00:31:51.890
Her friends…

380
00:31:51.890 --> 00:31:53.770
missing

381
00:31:54.350 --> 00:31:56.450
Are you polite?

382
00:32:08.730 --> 00:32:09.720
Jay

383
00:32:10.160 --> 00:32:13.050
we are still waiting for you

384
00:32:13.870 --> 00:32:15.320
welcome

385
00:32:15.320 --> 00:32:16.330
Give me some more radish kimchi

386
00:32:16.330 --> 00:32:17.500
good

387
00:32:17.500 --> 00:32:21.670
Zhu Yili works part-time
While thinking about the future direction

388
00:32:23.910 --> 00:32:25.620
Would you like to order a meal?

389
00:32:31.230 --> 00:32:33.160
You are more beautiful in person than in the photos

390
00:32:36.020 --> 00:32:37.550
you know who i am

391
00:32:37.550 --> 00:32:40.790
But it seems that I want to live a low-key life...

392
00:32:40.790 --> 00:32:42.990
She probably has no chance in this life

393
00:32:52.630 --> 00:32:57.980
Cui Jing was recommended by Ye Li
Choose the Department of Law

394
00:33:00.170 --> 00:33:01.590
But…

395
00:33:01.590 --> 00:33:03.100
she is still single

396
00:33:07.100 --> 00:33:08.560
it's so cute

397
00:33:08.940 --> 00:33:10.080
how old is it

398
00:33:10.520 --> 00:33:12.440
Because I'm busy studying law

399
00:33:12.440 --> 00:33:14.840
She has no time to look at men at all

400
00:33:18.490 --> 00:33:19.700
Let's go

401
00:33:19.700 --> 00:33:22.450
Probably before graduation

402
00:33:22.450 --> 00:33:24.240
She doesn't even want to fall in love, right?

403
00:33:24.800 --> 00:33:25.960
Cui Jing

404
00:33:25.960 --> 00:33:27.120
wait for me

405
00:33:29.540 --> 00:33:34.500
[Renren Adult Products Store]

406
00:33:48.650 --> 00:33:51.099
That person is just like an earthbound spirit

407
00:33:52.670 --> 00:33:54.650
Is Jai's father still out there?

408
00:33:54.650 --> 00:33:55.440
Yeah

409
00:33:55.970 --> 00:33:58.389
Should we just move?

410
00:33:58.389 --> 00:33:59.530
So what if I move?

411
00:33:59.530 --> 00:34:01.800
Will he find us yet?

412
00:34:02.130 --> 00:34:03.679
Ignore him

413
00:34:07.800 --> 00:34:10.580
Not even convicted of murder

414
00:34:10.580 --> 00:34:12.699
After a few months in jail, he was released

415
00:34:12.699 --> 00:34:14.619
Still haven't let us go yet

416
00:34:29.929 --> 00:34:32.449
I passed the High School Academic Ability Supervision Examination

417
00:34:32.449 --> 00:34:34.199
Currently preparing for the university entrance exam

418
00:34:37.260 --> 00:34:40.620
[College Entrance Examination Countdown to 7 Days]

419
00:34:44.080 --> 00:34:45.760
After not taking medicine

420
00:34:45.760 --> 00:34:48.840
Less time to study

421
00:34:48.840 --> 00:34:51.120
But my mind is much clearer than before

422
00:34:52.940 --> 00:34:57.160
I always feel that if I fall asleep, the exam will be over.
So I can only sit and take a nap

423
00:34:58.100 --> 00:35:00.860
But I only slept for a while
I actually had a dream

424
00:35:37.450 --> 00:35:38.550
Jay

425
00:35:40.460 --> 00:35:45.500
[University Entrance Examination Countdown to 1 Day]

